          <div class="absolute -top-3.5 left-6 bg-blue-600 text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-md flex items-center space-x-1">
            <i data-lucide="star" class="w-3 h-3 fill-current"></i>
            <span>메인 추천 교재</span>
