          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 relative">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-600 block mb-1">STEP 03</span>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm mb-1">답안지 활용</h4>
